{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act55side_level_act55side_01_beg","storyGroup":"act55side","storySort":2,"storyDependence":"act55side_level_act55side_st01","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TL-1","storyName":"庸俗的实践","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"九带领后方的整合运动与清剿感染者的第一集团军对抗，捕获了西尔卡；雷德与另一伙身份不明的队伍交火。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act55side/level_act55side_01_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act55side_01","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":0,"next":2,"characters":["九","整合运动战士","整合运动哨兵","被俘的乌萨斯士兵","西尔卡","雷德","米拉娜","整合运动术师","奥妮拉"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"charslot","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5e/Avg_bg_bg_newiceforest_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_tara_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"嘿……","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":13},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的哨兵躺倒在地上，脸颊紧贴着冰冷的泥雪。他的胸腔几乎没有起伏，只呼出丝丝白汽。","id":14},{"type":"dialog","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#9$1","id":16},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":17},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"0","vibrato":"5","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":18},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……醒醒，这样睡下去会出事的。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2432_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"呃……！","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"啊，我这是……我，我还留了一只耳朵听着动静呢！这段时间绝对没有集团军过来！","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"对不起……九，我又疏忽了……","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"没人怪你，这几天实在是太难为你们了。回去休息吧，我来替你。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"吃点东西，然后睡一会……在这冰窟窿里，也真亏你能睡得着。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2432_1#1$1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"嘿嘿……这环境倒是像小时候下矿，那时候偷懒也是这么睡觉的。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"可是……我们还有吃的吗？","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#2$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"放心吧……列文抓到两只羽兽煮了几锅汤，还剩了不少呢。快去吧。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d1/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2432_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":36},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的战士听到宽慰的话，反而消沉下来。","id":37},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2432_1#1$1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"九，你说塔露拉他们，会来救我们吗？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"还记得吗？这几年来，她从没有丢下过我们，一次都没有。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"放心吧，她会回来的。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2432_1#1$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"可是……这一次我倒是希望，他们别回来的好。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#3$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2432_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"九……就算你不说我也清楚，这次集团军派了这么多人来围剿我们，还是我们从来没见过的正规军，我们应该是逃不掉了。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"如果我们真的没救了，那塔露拉最好还是带着人去别的地方安家吧，别在这儿搭上更多人了，没必要。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"别这么想，我们好不容易走到了这里，差一点就能真正拥有自己的家了，难道你就甘心这么放弃？","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2432_1#1$1","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"嗐……我们刚刚建好农场的时候，我本来以为，我们从此就算有家了。我在矿场的时候可从来不敢想，自己还能过上这么好的日子。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"所以，我真的谢谢你……还有塔露拉、雷德老大。我知足了，真的。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动战士","text":"如果你还打算带人突围的话，先算我一个，不管能不能冲出去，哪怕再带走一两个集团军的杂碎，我这条命也就值了。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_2432_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"不许说这种话，我们的生命可远不是只值这点，我们还能做很多事呢。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#7$1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"我们会想办法活下去。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":60},{"type":"charslot","id":61},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":62},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowbootwalk","id":63},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#9$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"谁？","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2447_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动哨兵","text":"九！你也在吗？正好。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":72,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动哨兵","text":"居然有一个集团军的探子送上了门！我们把她逮住了，正准备去找你。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_2447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":74},{"type":"text","text":"哨兵让过身子，后面的两名整合运动成员把一个被绑缚的库兰塔，直接推到了九的面前。","id":75},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"multiline","name":"被俘的乌萨斯士兵","text":"……我只想和你们的头儿说话。我不是第四集团军的探子——","id":77},{"type":"multiline","name":"被俘的乌萨斯士兵","text":"呃……炎国人？","id":78},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#9$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……？","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被俘的乌萨斯士兵","text":"算了。","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被俘的乌萨斯士兵","text":"（不熟练的炎国语）我，不想，和你们打架。我不是——","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"（乌萨斯语）你身上的军服……你到底是谁？","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被俘的乌萨斯士兵","text":"……相信我，我不是集团军的人，而且我知道你们是谁。","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"被俘的乌萨斯士兵","text":"塔露拉，还有雷德，认识吗？","id":88},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#4$1","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……！","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"带这位客人回去，我要好好和她聊聊。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"charslot","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":96},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_bg_bg_cave_5.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":97},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#3$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……一个背叛了第四集团军的战士，一路刺杀了不少第一集团军的将领，结果又误打误撞地闯进了集团军围剿感染者的包围圈？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"西尔卡小姐，你讲的故事有点过于传奇了。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"集团军已经将整座山都围得严严实实，一只夜眼都飞不出去。那疯子手握这么大的优势，只要继续包围就行了，何必再派一个奸细？","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"但你要是实在不愿相信，我也可以理解。如果不是撞上了雅罗米尔那不要命的东西，我本来能逃掉，不用躲进这里来。","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"……不过，我交代了这么多，就不能至少先松开我的绳子？","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"无论如何，你穿着的都是集团军的军装。就算集团军之间有什么矛盾，也不代表你就是我们的朋友。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"在被第四集团军征召之前，他们叫我们“自由民”，被集团军驱逐之后，他们叫我们叛国者。","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"而现在……我的身份只剩下感染者了。","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"……","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":115},{"type":"text","text":"九仔细打量着眼前身穿军装的女性，她看上去的确风尘仆仆，受伤不轻。","id":116},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_magic_5","id":117},{"type":"text","text":"思考了一会，九拾起手边一片枯叶掷了出去，仿佛只是随着她心里一个念头的改变，绑在女性身上的绳索立即断裂。","id":118},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":121},{"type":"multiline","name":"西尔卡","text":"这是怎么做到——","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#2$1","id":123},{"type":"multiline","name":"西尔卡","end":"true","text":"多谢。","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#1$1","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"我再确认一遍，按你的说法，塔露拉他们真的已经顺利从泽尔格勒撤离了？","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#8$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"我亲眼见到的，我很确定。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#3$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"而在那之后不久，我们的根据地就遭遇了袭击……难道是塔露拉他们的行动暴露了农庄的位置？","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#3$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"我觉得不是。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"你们整合运动，是不是有一个头领，是一个年纪不大的卡特斯女孩？","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dc/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#9$1","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"整合运动的首领？卡特斯？","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#9$1","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"你不知道吗？从泽尔格勒撤离的时候，应该是有一个卡特斯带着不少感染者向南边走了。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#8$1","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"我不知道具体发生了什么，但根据我听到的传闻，那个卡特斯应该是狠狠得罪了那位元帅。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"所以第一集团军现在正发了疯地找那只小兔子，还顺便要对找到的所有感染者斩尽杀绝。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#9$1","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"这其中应该是有些误会……整合运动没有一位卡特斯的领袖。","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"我也很难想象，我认识的那位领导着感染者的卡特斯，会做出这种事。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#8$1","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"不管是不是误会，现在在整个乌萨斯境内，每一个集团军——每一个，都在大力清剿整合运动就是事实。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"源石矿脉不见了，这样下去整个乌萨斯都快要完蛋。没人知道该怎么做，他们只能先去抹除挑动他们敏感神经的潜在麻烦。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1983_1#4$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"九","text":"等等，你说所有集团军？开什么玩笑，乌萨斯哪里有这么多整合运动？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_npc_1983_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2249_1#9$1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"我到底是哪里没有说明白……","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔卡","text":"这么说吧。如果不是你们，那在半个月前，在中部地区和第七集团军狠狠打了一架的人是谁？","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b0/Avg_avg_npc_2249_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":153},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":154},{"type":"charslot","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","id":157},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9a/Avg_bg_34_g10_tent_inside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":158},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":160},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":161,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":162},{"type":"text","text":"夜已深，行军的营帐里还有一人未眠。","id":163},{"type":"text","text":"她借着微弱月光与烛光，翻阅着随身携带的纸页，一字一顿地默读着。","id":164},{"type":"dialog","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":167},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"一个人？","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"晚上好，雷德先生。你还没有休息吗？","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"刚巡营完，我们试着用你的办法给队伍加上了“编制”，管理效率的确提升了不少。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"不得不说，你带队伍挺有一手的。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"这是根据过往经历总结出的经验，不能算我一个人的创作。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"在看书吗？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"不是什么书，我在读一位朋友寄来的信件。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"你好像一直随身带着这些信，是很重要的朋友？","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"是朋友，也算是我的老师。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我们是在北原的矿场上认识的，后来他因为一些原因离开了乌萨斯，还是会常常写信给我们。","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"他是一个知识渊博的人，他向我们讲述了一个远大的理想，也教会了我们看待这片大地的方式。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"在矿场上学习，那应该是真够难的。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"是的，一开始，我认识的字很少。可是他告诉我们，我们并不需要太多复杂的语言，我们只用记住一句话。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"“我们要求平等，因为没有任何一个人理应拥有压迫另一个人的特权。”","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"有时候，人们会用自身熟知的东西，去描述一个复杂的人。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"感染者，健康人。乌萨斯人，卡西米尔人。穷人，富人……","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"这些区别或许真实存在，可是我不明白，凭什么这些不同就能成为压迫的正当理由。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我们不同，但不该因此就要成为别人的主人或奴隶。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我在努力理解他说的话，也在努力践行。但是我读得很慢，我还在……努力学习。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"对了，雷德先生感兴趣的话，也可以拿去看的。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2f/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"我？还是算了吧。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"现在不是读这些东西的时候。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"但我们要建立的，不就是一个任何人在任何时候，都可以静下来读书的地方吗？","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"而且，需要的话，我也很乐意现在读给你听。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"还是等将来有机会吧——听说你和塔露拉吵架了。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"吵架？她是这么说的吗。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"早些时候我们讨论了接下来的行动方向，塔露拉坚持要想办法营救被集团军包围的同伴，但我却不能完全同意。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我的意见是，如果我们没有足够的把握可以通过这场战斗救出被困的同伴，我们应该直接放弃武装冲突，保留现有的有生力量。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我和她谁都没有说服对方，最后，我很坦诚地告诉她，如果她执意要带领队伍进行冒险的军事行动，我会带领原本跟随我的队伍离开。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"听上去，我们就是管这个叫吵架。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"非常抱歉，我本不想在刚加入队伍的时候就带来这样的麻烦。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"没关系，我懂。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"唉，我也只是想来告诉你，塔露拉不是个不讲理的人。每次需要有人拿主意的时候，她也不会自己一个人拍板的。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"但这次毕竟关系到我们同伴的死活，很多同伴。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"不止是她，我们每个人，都很难冷静。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我当然可以理解。我也失去过许多同伴，我知道那是什么样的痛苦。但这不该是我们贸然开启战斗的理由。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0f/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"别说是为了营救同伴，哪怕是与我们从不相识的被压迫者——只要我们确定行动是可行的，是利大于弊的，我们当然会这么做。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"关键在于，让我们做出决定的，应该是理性的判断，而不是一时意气。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"雷德先生，我一直坚信，我们在进行一项艰难但伟大的斗争，在这个过程中我们永远都会面临无法避免的牺牲，我们必须得接受。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我也希望，塔露拉能够同意这一点。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"虽然是这个理……","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"不过至少在当下，我们达成的共识是，要探查清楚集团军在这里驻军的情况，然后才能做下一步决定。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"我得说，你这人和看上去的样子还挺不同的——你可真是个狠角色。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我不明白，之前从来没有人这样评价过我——","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":241},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","volume":"0.5","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":243},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$escape_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":244,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"哪里的声音？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":247},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":250},{"type":"dialog","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"charslot","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","id":254},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_bg_79_g22_snowbase_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":258},{"type":"text","text":"他走出营帐，几步爬上不远处的小土坡，注视着远处。","id":259},{"type":"dialog","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"怎么了？","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"有人过来了……这个时候，难道是集团军……","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"我得先过去看看，那里扎营的都是新兵，他们需要我。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2225_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"我去通知塔露拉还有其他人。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米拉娜","text":"要小心，雷德。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2225_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_bg_79_g22_snowbase_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2431_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动术师","text":"你来了，雷德！我刚发现前面有动静。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_2431_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"雷德点点头，扫视着这支队伍，他看到了一些眼熟的面孔——有好几位都是泽尔格勒的工人。","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"出城后，他们自告奋勇，加入了战斗的队伍。","id":281},{"type":"text","text":"有的人接受过一些训练，但没有人真正上过战场。他们握紧了弩箭，死死盯着黑黢黢的前方。","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"……","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"有多少人？身份能确认吗？","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2431_1#1$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"整合运动术师","text":"不清楚，我喊了几句，没有回应。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_2431_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"把望远镜给我。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":290},{"type":"text","text":"昏暗的月色下，雷德看到了至少数十个来回穿梭的身影，他们停在森林的边缘，拿着铲子把壕沟不断地挖深。","id":291},{"type":"text","text":"另一些人从后方，把一个个物资箱堆叠在了最前面，旋即架上了重弩与火炮。","id":292},{"type":"text","text":"看上去不像是打算进攻，反倒像是出于保守的自卫。","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"这是在做什么……？","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"但好消息是，从衣服和装备上看，倒不像是集团军……","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"话音未落，几个黑影从壕沟中翻出，他们缓缓地靠近整合运动的防线，手中光芒闪烁。","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"源石技艺……这是进攻，还是想传递信号？奥妮拉，你能看懂吗？","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2431_1#1$1","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥妮拉","text":"不行，看不懂对面是什么来历。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_npc_2431_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"……","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"所有人留在原地做好准备。我会试着和他们打个招呼，如果他们有别的动作，你们就直接开火。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"当心点，我们现在随时可能面临真正的战争。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"dialog","id":308},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":309},{"type":"charslot","id":310},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0","id":311},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","fadetime":"0","id":312},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_glow_42i11_01","layer":"1","x":"-1035","y":"-200","id":313},{"type":"delay","time":"0.25","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"text","text":"几名新兵都点了点头，雷德起身向那片逼近的光芒缓缓走去。","id":316},{"type":"dialog","id":317},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.1","duration":"3","yTo":"20","x":"-100","block":"false","id":318},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_glow_42i11_01","layer":"1","x":"-1035","xto":"-1080","y":"-200","yto":"-190","movetime":"3","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"2.25","id":320},{"type":"text","text":"来者手中的光芒愈发明亮……雷德眯起眼睛，探向背后的刀柄。","id":321},{"type":"text","text":"还差一点，只要再引目标往前十几步，只要对面有一点动手的想法，我的刀就能抢先劈中——","id":322},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"0.5","id":324},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrowshot","id":325},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":326},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":327},{"type":"bgeffect","id":328},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0","fadetime":"0.5","id":329},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"0","fadetime":"0.5","id":330},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"0.5","yTo":"0","x":"0","block":"false","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":332},{"type":"text","text":"一支弩矢从身后飞向那几束光，旋即所有的光亮消散，几个黑影迅速缩回对面的壕沟。","id":333},{"type":"text","text":"雷德瞪着眼睛，回头看向发射弩箭的方向，一个稚气未脱的青年举着弩愣在原地，双手微微颤抖。","id":334},{"type":"text","text":"紧接着，则是来自对方数十倍火力的还击。","id":335},{"type":"dialog","id":336},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrowshot","channel":"a","volume":"0.8","id":337},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0.95","g":"0.95","b":"0.95","fadetime":"0.02","block":"true","id":338},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.12","block":"true","id":339},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.25","xstrength":"18","ystrength":"14","vibrato":"28","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":340},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrowshot","channel":"b","volume":"0.7","id":341},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.45","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.02","block":"true","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_arrowshot","channel":"c","volume":"0.9","id":344},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","volume":"0.35","id":345},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"22","ystrength":"18","vibrato":"35","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":346},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"0.9","b":"0.7","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":347},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.25","block":"true","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":349},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$batmeeting_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_batmeeting_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":350,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_328_1#1$1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"搞什么……","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"35","ystrength":"35","vibrato":"20","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"雷德","text":"所有人，列阵迎敌！","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_npc_328_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"bgeffect","id":358},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":359},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":360},{"type":"image","id":361},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":362}],"characters":["九","整合运动战士","整合运动哨兵","被俘的乌萨斯士兵","西尔卡","雷德","米拉娜","整合运动术师","奥妮拉"]}